{"server":"cn","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_03_beg","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_03","title":"恶客盈门","storyCode":"PV-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c079a0bfc99465264b72fcc97ef68aa7cc3782ed612aacc15842b5309453b800","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"为了弄清女儿铃兰受伤的真相，威尼斯家族曾经的杀手英格丽接受狼之主的委托，前来保护他的獠牙——一个老裁缝。老裁缝的孙子在送货途中意外目击车祸现场，被威尼斯家族成员劫持。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月1日    8:10 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以至于猎人的后代，都习惯了这样挺括又舒适的穿着......慢慢地，它发展成了叙拉古人如今最常穿的套装。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......爷爷，这没头没尾的故事，我几岁的时候您就在讲，我都十几岁了，您还在讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢奇诺，这两套套装已经做得差不多了，现在就剩下纽扣没有加上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你已经自作主张替店里接下了订单，不管客人是什么身份，我们都不能马虎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去里屋把那几枚特制的纽扣取来，上面有萨卢佐的家徽，你不会认错的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可按您教的规矩，我们不应该先带着这两套衣服去找那位拉普兰德小姐试衣，修改完再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，那位萨卢佐家的小姐并不需要。衣服合身与否，我会判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可她下单时没提过这个要求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在期待什么，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时，客人们对套装的要求繁琐细致，有时却又含糊其辞，但我们都不能多问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记住，卢奇诺，德蒙塔诺信誉好的原因，绝不仅仅是懂得量体裁衣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人和料子没什么不同，我们得自己判断，哪些料子能碰，哪些料子碰不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去拿纽扣吧，这单生意该结了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"卢奇诺看着那两套无比华丽的礼服，它们与过往爷爷所经手的任何一套套装都不一样。\n无疑，那是能冠以“德蒙塔诺出品”的杰作。他多希望，自己也能参与其中。\n卢奇诺下意识摸了摸自己的口袋，里面安静地放着几枚他私下做好的纽扣，上面刻着萨卢佐家的标志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就拿过来，爷爷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您已经在门外站很久了，请进吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老翁贝托，安东尼奥先生交代的差事实在没法拖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老家主已经快到新沃尔西尼了，现在去还赶得上在狂欢节巡游之前替他把新衣做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推掉其他所有的委托，和我去一趟威尼斯载具公司，不会花上太久的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在我手上的这份委托，我同样得罪不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷，我听到了有客人来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老翁贝托，其实量体这种小事，也不必你亲自去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，想去见见真正的大人物吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？大、大人物？爷爷，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢奇诺，先把纽扣给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这，爷爷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小裁缝紧张地盯着爷爷的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但还达不到能用在这两套衣服上的标准，卢奇诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可我比较了很久，它们没什么不同！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你缝的扣子够多了，你也能在摸到它们的时候就知道是否合适。去拿我的纽扣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这，给，它们都在这！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我、我只是想要帮上您的忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老翁贝托，要我看，你对一个孩子过于苛刻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续去做你的练习，卢奇诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，练习。等我替您取完药回来，我会乖乖去练习的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您也看到了，这孩子还太冒失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在消遣我，老翁贝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，先生，狂欢节当前，最近的订单多到实在忙不过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向您保证，等到我手上这笔订单结束，我会亲自到府上去找那位客人道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，后续的费用都由我来出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为安东尼奥先生在乎这些？我也只在乎自己能安安心心过个节，老翁贝托——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"翁贝托·德蒙塔诺，你果然在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i23"},{"type":"narration","text":"狐狸还乡"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不应该出现在这里，扎罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为被拔去獠牙的失败者，你应该回到荒野，静待下一轮游戏开始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，恺撒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我知道，你作为本轮游戏最有可能成为头狼的竞争者，没法不急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从你身上嗅到了浓重的人类气息，你已经物色好了新的玩物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，为何找我？扎罗，你想从我这索求更多的安慰吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你哄骗你那小狼崽子的把戏我已经看腻烦了，“外婆”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我唤你来此，是为了向你分享一个有趣的秘密——最后一位尚未现身的獠牙，到底藏在哪儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不该干涉游戏，你在破坏规矩，出局者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可局外人恰恰最喜欢看戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恺撒，你那副慈悲外表下隐藏的血腥味和舔舐胜利的渴望......你从来都瞒不过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，我也不在乎你是否愿意知道这个秘密。无论如何，我都会享受这份乐趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的狼崽子嗅觉不错，可惜本轮游戏至今仍未现身的獠牙花费了数十年去洗清身上的狼味——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翁贝托·德蒙塔诺，一个可悲的裁缝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扎罗，我保证等到这轮游戏结束，你会同样享受到被我们撕咬的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恺撒，你的愤怒依旧美味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但可惜，我甚至不是第一头挑战我们规矩的狼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃尔珀？游客？抱歉，德蒙塔诺的预约已经满了，暂时不营业了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微笑的女人","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是老板？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你管我是不是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"他没敢把话说完。\n因为他看到了对方手里的刀。\n对了，刀，在这座城市，有多久没看到有人这么自然地带着武器出门了？\n女人的嘴角还挂着笑意，但他有种感觉，再多说一个字，对方的刀就会捅穿自己的喉咙，哪怕这是在新沃尔西尼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，女士，这位先生是威尼斯载具公司的员工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微笑的女人","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“载具公司”？看来我离开之后，家里的变化很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沃尔珀......她脸上的疤......这身衣服，还有这把刀——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她是当年那个叛逃出家族的杀人狂......可她不是六年前就已经......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，请先回吧，麻烦替我向安东尼奥先生致意。当然，我刚才的保证绝对有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......你......我......*叙拉古粗口*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（谢了，翁贝托。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格丽女士，看上去你的变化并不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟当年你的照片在报纸上霸占了头条很长时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你会先把重回叙拉古的行程通知给你的家里人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经脱离威尼斯家族多年了——我是来找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你并非为杀我而来，你身上有我熟悉的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。他托关系找到了东国，我们做了一个交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g10_easternhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定你要一边在红叶里打滚晒太阳，一边和我说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（巨大的哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不是那头狼和我有点交情，我连话都懒得帮他带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我回到叙拉古......替一个人做保镖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是“解决麻烦”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后你就可以知晓你一直求而不得的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么当年你杀了那么多人，却依然找不到伤害了你女儿的凶手。以及，那个人到底是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这真的不是你为了赶我走想的托辞吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵哈，爱信不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"除了他，我应该是整个神社里唯一一个不讨厌你的了，英格丽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每次看你为了见他一面，一路从外面杀进来，我还挺开心的，不然神社的日子真的有点太无聊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，我都有点想跟你回叙拉古逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一座很深的泥潭......你这样死倔死倔又喜欢打滚的家伙是不会喜欢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟他说一声，我回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的兽主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不自己跟他说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽萨的事，他会理解的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到叙拉古后，我也见过了狼之主。翁贝托·德蒙塔诺，如果不是他亲口向我确认，我实在难以想象他会选择你这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这样一个不起眼的裁缝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道瓦古如何向你提起我，但我和他在某些事情上的认知确实有些微妙的分歧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的状态很不对劲，翁贝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按瓦古的描述，他们这些狼所选择的人都理应在某一方面有着傲人的天赋，可你实在太虚弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才出门去的那个孩子，就是你的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢奇诺他是个聪明的孩子，只是暂时还不能接受我们没法打败时间的事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我老了，英格丽，就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没法评判对他们而言，什么是好什么是坏......不过，他没找过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已经许多年没有再找过我了，我还以为他早已抛弃了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能只是不想让你再沾染上他的味道，这对你来说安全些。我猜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，翁贝托，你和瓦古之间的事情我没兴趣知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是来替你解决麻烦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他给我留下了些分辨其他獠牙的手段。与其等着那些人找你麻烦，我想，最快的办法是我主动去找他们的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来他开出的条件让你都没法拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这座泥潭，一旦踏进了半只脚，就没那么容易离开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    11:00 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......一会儿见到了阿尔贝托先生，是不是得细致地为他解释这套礼服的设计？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不行，爷爷知道了一定会生气的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果是阿尔贝托先生自己问起，我总不能拒绝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能认识萨卢佐家族的家主，对德蒙塔诺来说不是坏事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样也许能帮爷爷拿到更好的药，说不定还能带他去哥伦比亚看更好的医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，别胡思乱想了，卢奇诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德小姐给的地址，我记得是在这个方向——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......卡车？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么开这么快，会撞上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卢奇诺抱着保存礼服的精美盒子站在街角，就这么目睹了一场车祸的发生。\n一辆载满货物的卡车就这么突然撞上了刚刚准备拐过路口的轿车。\n玻璃碎片撒满了现场，轿车车身也已变形。一个轮胎从卡车车厢内蹦了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......救、救人......对，救人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，现在大伙都去主街区那边看竞演了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，车里面的人坚持住，我来想办法救你们出来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这些是什么......轮胎里面还有其他东西？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这，甘比诺，真是我们盯的那辆车！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明只是喝口咖啡的工夫，怎么......这下全他妈完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来只分到个打掩护的活儿就已经够倒霉了。苦劳全是我们，功劳一点捞不上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这批货还在我们眼皮子底下出了问题——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕更糟，你看看被撞的那辆轿车，是不是很眼熟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这时候你还关心他妈的谁被撞了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那是，莱昂图索的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在得承认之前你说回龙门的打算不算糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁警察和老板还没来得及反应，赶紧走，我们之间的账可以回龙门之后再慢慢算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易在这有点盼头，现在绝对不能认怂，别忘了我们来新沃尔西尼投奔威尼斯载具公司的原因是啥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有西西里夫人，没有灰厅，甚至没有其他家族的掣肘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定，我们能在这混出个自己的家族来，甘比诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到街对面那个抱着盒子的小子了吗？现在这条路就他一个人看到了车祸，会不会他也不小心看到了卡车里藏的其他货？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我懂你的意思了，他有没有真看到的确是我们说了算。你真是个坏种，卡彭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是找条活路罢了，顺便在老板面前立个功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，把他带回去，说我们把现场唯一的目击者控制住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些货？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是接货人需要考虑的事。别忘了，老板再三强调，我们只是打掩护的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于莱昂图索......哼，愿他无恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得快，不能让那小子被其他人给抢先带走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还有人来帮忙？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这，车里还有人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晕死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来扛他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这小子手里的那个箱子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起拿走，别留下任何线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定我们躲开监控了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"废话，我来这儿的第一件事就是摸清周围状况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"narration","text":"“已打烊”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咖啡馆里静悄悄的，只有门口的招牌偶尔传来“滋滋”的电流声。\n“歇业三天，欢迎新老顾客为我女儿欧菲莉娅的竞演投票，要是她获得了狂欢节当晚点亮花车的资格，一周内咖啡全部免费！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"气味，很浓烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红知道你逃到了这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"narration","text":"红手中的匕首与闪过的箭头擦出了火花，她的手被震得微微发麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反应很快嘛，难怪能在我狩猎的时候撑这么久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过你中计了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红抓住你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好痛！如果你不是獠牙，我真想邀请你也加入兽群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜阿涅塞不会同意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆还在等红......红必须先狩猎你......然后再去狩猎最后一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你在犹豫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，红不再犹豫了。红不想让凯尔希失望，但更不想让外婆失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可别靠猎人太近哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"子月转身射出一箭的同时，迅速侧身撞破玻璃，来到街道上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动，这一箭我绝对不会失手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在把你拖到阿涅塞面前之前，我需要确认一件事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看来瓦古的确没有骗我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狼群果然都躁动起来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到你们，可花了我不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过接下来的事，反倒简单了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你身上有阿涅塞讨厌的味道，但你不是獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红，你认识她吗？放心走出来，我拉弓的手很稳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"但她的刀，比红的锋利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也没把握？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红，我们这样可没法分出胜负。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红会比你快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红色的身影迅速冲向英格丽，而子月手中的弓也迅速转向提着刀的沃尔珀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不会比我的箭更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三支箭内，我会把她逼到角落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在你的背后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想让我分心？啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去在叙拉古，我处理过比这更棘手的情况，同时动手的人也更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无一例外，躺下的绝不会是我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她手中的刀鞘里，稳稳地插着三支长箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别将人与兽群等同，你狩猎野兽的那套技巧，在我面前没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可继续试试。当然，你也是，“红”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会找到你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红的刀，需要更锋利......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们没法躲太久的。瓦古欠我的答案，我已经等不了了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城里的警察效率这么高？我也得撤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车祸，獠牙，还有威尼斯家族的影子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，叙拉古果然会用更大的惊喜欢迎我回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["红"]}]}
